   "id": "yb-2-4-approach",
   "h": "Algorithm: Cyanosis (เล่มเหลือง 2.4)",
   "html": "<div class=\"flow\" data-flow=\"y24a\"></div><p>แยก <b>Peripheral cyanosis</b> (เขียวที่ผิวหนัง ไม่เขียวที่เยื่อบุ) ออกจาก <b>Central cyanosis</b> (เขียวทั้งเยื่อบุและผิวหนัง) แล้วแยกสาเหตุของ central cyanosis ตาม Low O<sub>2</sub> sat หรือ Hb abnormal</p>",
   "sub": [
    {
     "id": "yb-2-4-periph",
     "h": "Peripheral cyanosis",
     "html": "<p>Cyanosis involve skin · Spare mucous membrane</p><ul><li>Reduce cardiac output</li><li>Cold exposure</li><li>Venous obstruction</li><li>Arterial obstruction<ul><li>PAD</li><li>Emboli</li></ul></li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "id": "yb-2-4-central",
     "h": "Central cyanosis",
     "html": "<p>Cyanosis involve mucous membrane and skin — แบ่งเป็น Low O<sub>2</sub> sat และ Hb abnormal</p>",
     "sub": [
      {
       "id": "yb-2-4-hb",
       "h": "Hb abnormal",
       "html": "<ul><li>Methemoglobinemia</li><li>Sulfhemoglobinemia</li></ul>"
      },
      {
       "id": "yb-2-4-lowo2",
       "h": "Low O₂ sat",
       "html": "<ul><li><b>RS</b><ul><li>Parenchyma: Alveolar Hypovent, V/Q mismatch, Diffusion defect</li><li>Vascular: Pulmonary AVF, PE</li></ul></li><li><b>Low FiO<sub>2</sub></b></li><li><b>Cardio</b>: Cyanotic heart Dz “5T+2E”</li></ul>"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "yb-2-4-5t2e",
     "h": "Cyanotic heart disease “5T + 2E”",
     "html": "<p><b>5T</b></p><ul><li>TOF: Tetralogy of fallot</li><li>TGV: Transposition of Great vessel</li><li>TA: Truncus Arteriosus</li><li>Tricuspid atresia</li><li>TAPVR: Total Anomalous Pulmonary Venous Return</li></ul><p><b>2E</b></p><ul><li>Ebstein anomaly</li><li>Eisenmenger physiology in ASD/VSD/PDA</li></ul>"
    }
   ]
